Move a pane out of its window into a new window, or make it floating.
.It Xr tmux-capture-pane 1
Capture pane contents to a buffer or standard output.
.It Xr tmux-choose-client 1
Choose an attached client interactively from a list.
.It Xr tmux-choose-tree 1
