.It Xr tmux-customize-mode 1
Browse and change options and key bindings in a pane.
.It Xr tmux-switch-mode 1
Choose a session or window from an interactive list.
.Tg displayp
.Tg findw
.It Xr tmux-display-panes 1
Show pane indicators and allow a pane to be selected.
.Tg joinp
.It Xr tmux-find-window 1
Search window names, pane titles, and visible pane content.
.Tg killp
.It Xr tmux-join-pane 1
Move a pane into another pane's window, splitting the destination pane.
.Tg killw
.It Xr tmux-kill-pane 1
Destroy a pane.
.Tg lastp
.It Xr tmux-kill-window 1
Destroy a window and remove it from all sessions.
.Tg last
.It Xr tmux-last-pane 1
Select the previously active pane in a window.
.Tg link
