Select the previously selected window.
.Tg lsp
.It Xr tmux-link-window 1
Link a window into a session without removing its existing link.
.Tg lsw
.It Xr tmux-list-panes 1
List panes in a window, session, or across the server.
.Tg movep
.It Xr tmux-list-windows 1
List windows in a session or across the server.
.Tg movew
.It Xr tmux-move-pane 1
Move a pane into another window or reposition a floating pane.
.Tg neww
.It Xr tmux-move-window 1
Move a window to another index or session.
.Tg newp
.It Xr tmux-new-window 1
Create a window in the current session.
.Tg nextl
.It Xr tmux-new-pane 1
Create a floating pane in the current window.
.Tg next
