Move a window to the next layout and rearrange its panes to fit.
.Tg pipep
.It Xr tmux-next-window 1
Move to the next window in a session.
.Tg prevl
.It Xr tmux-pipe-pane 1
Pipe pane output to a shell command or send command output to a pane.
.Tg prev
.It Xr tmux-previous-layout 1
Move the target window to the previous layout in the session.
.Tg renamew
.It Xr tmux-previous-window 1
Move to the previous window in a session.
.Tg resizep
.It Xr tmux-rename-window 1
Rename the current window.
.Tg resizew
.It Xr tmux-resize-pane 1
Resize a pane by an adjustment or to an absolute size.
.Tg respawnp
.It Xr tmux-resize-window 1
Increase or decrease a window's size.
.Tg respawnw
.It Xr tmux-respawn-pane 1
